\ Not supported yet (Forth review of small-tactics-1, finding 9): at[ hv v ]
\ asks hv before v, on which it depends; revert-kept refuses an argument
\ that depends on a later one (thrown invalid, the runner's 93, exit 2).
\ Pinned Lean refuses it too: "failed to create binder due to failure
\ when reverting variable dependencies".
\ Lean: theorem u_gen_dep (a b : Nat) (v : Fin (a + b)) (hv : v = v) : a = a := by
\         generalize a + b = x at hv v
\         rfl
theorem u_gen_dep
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  a b + Fin explicit: v  v v = explicit: hv  a a =
:= by
  a b + by-generalize: x at[ hv v ]
  by-rfl
end u_gen_dep
